{{#fillSection "metaDescription"}}Real-time map of the organization's device fleet.{{/fillSection}}
{{!--
  Fleet Map
  - Layout: "Tracker Layout"
  - pageData esperado (desde el workflow de la página):
      googleMapsApiKey  (string, requerido)
      googleMapsMapId   (string, opcional; por defecto DEMO_MAP_ID)
      organization.name (string, opcional)
      devices           (array, opcional; primer render sin esperar al polling)
  - Datos en vivo: GET /api/fleet  y  GET /api/fleet/devices/{deviceId}/history?minutes=N
  - Geofences:     GET/POST /api/geofences,  PATCH/DELETE /api/geofences/{geofenceId}
  - Eventos:       GET /api/alarms?limit=N&type=T
    (contratos y workflows en losant-workflows/README.md)
  - Modo demo: agregar ?demo=1 a la URL.
  IMPORTANTE: el JS/CSS de esta página no debe contener llaves dobles (Handlebars).
--}}
<style>
  .fleet {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 340px minmax(0, 1fr);
  }

  /* ---------- Sidebar ---------- */
  .fs {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 0;
    background: var(--panel);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    z-index: 10;
  }
  .fs-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 18px 18px 12px;
  }
  .fs-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .fs-org {
    margin: 2px 0 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -.015em;
    line-height: 1.25;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .fs-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 0 18px 12px;
  }
  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 2px;
    padding: 8px 9px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--panel-2);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    min-width: 0;
    transition: border-color .15s, background .15s;
  }
  .stat:hover { background: var(--panel-hover); }
  .stat[aria-pressed="true"] { border-color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .stat-n { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .stat-l {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
  .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none; background: var(--c, var(--offline)); }
  .stat--moving { --c: var(--moving); }
  .stat--idle { --c: var(--idle); }
  .stat--offline { --c: var(--offline); }

  .fs-tools {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 0 18px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .search {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0 10px;
    height: 36px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--panel-2);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .search:focus-within { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .search input {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    border: 0;
    outline: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .select {
    height: 36px;
    padding: 0 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--panel-2);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .fs-list {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    overflow-y: auto;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .dv {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
    outline: none;
    --c: var(--offline);
  }
  .dv:hover { background: var(--panel-hover); }
  .dv:focus-visible { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--accent); }
  .dv.is-selected { background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .dv--moving { --c: var(--moving); }
  .dv--idle { --c: var(--idle); }
  .dv-dot {
    position: relative;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c);
    flex: none;
  }
  .dv--moving .dv-dot::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c);
    animation: ping 1.8s ease-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes ping {
    0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: .6; }
    100% { transform: scale(2.6); opacity: 0; }
  }
  .dv-main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .dv-name { font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .dv-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .dv-meta { text-align: right; flex: none; }
  .dv-speed { font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .dv-time { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; }
  .fs-empty { padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); }
  .fs-empty[hidden] { display: none; }

  .fs-foot {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .live { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; min-width: 0; }
  .live i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--offline); flex: none; }
  .live[data-state="live"] i { background: var(--moving); animation: blink 2s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .live[data-state="error"] i { background: var(--danger); }
  .live[data-state="paused"] i { background: var(--idle); }
  @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: .35; } }

  .btn-ghost, .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    height: 30px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--panel);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover, .btn:hover { background: var(--panel-hover); }
  .btn[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
  .icon-btn {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    flex: none;
  }
  .icon-btn:hover { background: var(--panel-hover); color: var(--text); }
  .fs-close { display: none; }
  .fs-backdrop { display: none; }

  /* ---------- Mapa ---------- */
  .fm { position: relative; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; }
  .fm-map { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: var(--panel-2); }
  .fm-msg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--muted);
    background: var(--panel-2);
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .fm-msg[hidden] { display: none; }
  .fm-msg strong { display: block; color: var(--text); font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .fm-banner {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    max-width: min(560px, calc(100% - 32px));
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--danger);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    font-size: 13px;
    z-index: 6;
  }
  .fm-banner[hidden] { display: none; }
  .fm-banner a { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .fm-banner code { font-size: 12px; padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--panel-2); }
  .fm-controls {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    z-index: 5;
  }
  .ctl {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--panel);
    color: var(--text);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .ctl:hover { background: var(--panel-hover); }
  .ctl[aria-pressed="true"] { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .fm-fab {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    left: 12px;
    top: 14px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 40px;
    padding: 0 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--panel);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    z-index: 5;
  }
  .fm-fab span {
    min-width: 22px;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  /* ---------- Panel de detalle ---------- */
  .dp {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    left: 14px;
    width: 340px;
    max-height: calc(100% - 28px);
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--panel);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    z-index: 5;
  }
  .dp[hidden] { display: none; }
  .dp-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; }
  .dp-title { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .dp-title h2 { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -.01em; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .dp-title p { margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--panel-2);
    --c: var(--offline);
  }
  .badge::before { content: ""; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--c); }
  .badge--moving { --c: var(--moving); }
  .badge--idle { --c: var(--idle); }
  .dp-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 14px 0 10px;
  }
  .kv { padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 9px; background: var(--panel-2); min-width: 0; }
  .kv span { display: block; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
  .kv strong { display: block; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .dp-coords {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .dp-coords span { flex: 1; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .link-btn { border: 0; background: none; color: var(--accent); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; padding: 2px 4px; }
  .dp-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .dp-range { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-left: auto; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  .dp-range .select { height: 30px; font-size: 12px; }
  .dp-history { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); min-height: 1em; }
  .rp {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding: 8px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--panel-2);
  }
  .rp[hidden] { display: none; }
  .rp-play {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    cursor: pointer;
    flex: none;
  }
  .rp-main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .rp-bar { display: block; width: 100%; margin: 0; accent-color: var(--accent); cursor: pointer; }
  .rp-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .rp .select { height: 28px; padding: 0 4px; font-size: 12px; }
  .dp-section { margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .dp-section[hidden] { display: none; }
  .dp-section h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; }
  .chip { padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--panel-2); font-size: 12px; }
  .chip b { font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); }
  .dp-extras { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 4px 12px; margin: 0; font-size: 13px; }
  .dp-extras dt { color: var(--muted); }
  .dp-extras dd { margin: 0; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

  /* ---------- Marcadores (AdvancedMarkerElement) ---------- */
  .vm {
    position: relative;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transform: translateY(50%);
    --c: var(--moving);
  }
  .vm--idle { --c: var(--idle); }
  .vm--offline { --c: var(--offline); opacity: .85; }
  .vm-body {
    position: relative;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c);
    border: 2.5px solid #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
  }
  .vm-body::after { content: ""; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; }
  .vm-arrow {
    display: none;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    fill: #fff;
    transform: rotate(var(--rot, 0deg));
    transition: transform .8s ease;
  }
  .vm--moving.has-heading .vm-arrow { display: block; }
  .vm--moving.has-heading .vm-body::after { display: none; }
  .vm--replay { --c: var(--accent); }
  .vm--replay .vm-arrow { display: block; }
  .vm--replay .vm-body::after { display: none; }
  .vm-pulse { position: absolute; inset: 2px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--c); opacity: 0; }
  .vm--moving .vm-pulse { animation: vm-pulse 2s ease-out infinite; }
  @keyframes vm-pulse {
    0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: .45; }
    100% { transform: scale(2.3); opacity: 0; }
  }
  .vm-label {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(100% + 3px);
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--panel);
    color: var(--text);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity .15s;
  }
  .show-labels .vm-label, .vm:hover .vm-label, .vm.is-selected .vm-label { opacity: 1; }
  .vm.is-selected .vm-body {
    transform: scale(1.2);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--accent-soft), 0 0 0 2px var(--accent), 0 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4);
  }
  .vh-start {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff;
    border: 3px solid var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(50%);
  }

  /* ---------- Pestañas del sidebar ---------- */
  .fs-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3px;
    margin: 0 18px 12px;
    padding: 3px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--panel-2);
  }
  .fs-tab, .seg button {
    flex: 1;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    height: 30px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .fs-tab:hover, .seg button:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .fs-tab[aria-selected="true"], .seg button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--panel); color: var(--text); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
  .fs-tab-n {
    min-width: 18px;
    padding: 0 5px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: var(--danger);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 16px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .fs-tab-n[hidden] { display: none; }
  .fs-view { display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; min-height: 0; }
  .fs-view[hidden] { display: none; }
  .fs-tools .btn { height: 36px; }
  .fs-tools .select { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .btn.btn-primary { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
  .btn.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent); filter: brightness(1.08); }
  .btn.btn-danger { color: var(--danger); }
  .btn:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: default; }

  /* ---------- Listas de geofences y eventos ---------- */
  .gf, .ev {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
    outline: none;
  }
  .gf:hover, .ev:hover { background: var(--panel-hover); }
  .gf:focus-visible, .ev:focus-visible { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--accent); }
  .gf.is-selected { background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .gf-sw { width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--c); flex: none; }
  .gf--circle .gf-sw { border-radius: 50%; }
  .gf--off { opacity: .55; }
  .gf-in { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--moving); white-space: nowrap; }
  .ev { align-items: flex-start; }
  .ev-ic {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--panel-2);
    color: var(--c, var(--danger));
    flex: none;
  }
  .ev--enter { --c: var(--moving); }
  .ev--exit { --c: var(--idle); }
  .ev-main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .ev-msg { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .ev-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ---------- Geofences en el mapa ---------- */
  .gf-label {
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--panel);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--c);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(50%);
    transition: opacity .15s;
  }
  .show-gf-labels .gf-label { opacity: .92; }
  .gp-vx {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff;
    border: 2px solid var(--text);
    transform: translateY(50%);
  }
  .gp-vx--first { width: 16px; height: 16px; border-width: 3px; cursor: pointer; }
  .ev-pin {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c, var(--danger));
    border: 3px solid #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--accent-soft), 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35);
    transform: translateY(50%);
  }
  .chip-gf { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text); }
  .chip-gf:hover { background: var(--panel-hover); }
  .chip-gf i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--c); }

  /* ---------- Editor de geofences ---------- */
  .gp [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .fld { display: block; margin-top: 12px; }
  .fld > span { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); }
  .fld em { font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; }
  .input {
    width: 100%;
    height: 34px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--panel-2);
    outline: 0;
  }
  .input:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .seg { display: flex; gap: 3px; padding: 3px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--panel-2); }
  .gp-hint { margin: 12px 0 0; padding: 9px 11px; border-radius: 9px; background: var(--accent-soft); font-size: 12px; }
  .gp-tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .swatches { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .swatch {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 2px solid var(--panel);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--border);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .swatch[aria-pressed="true"] { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--text); }
  .gp-check { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer; }
  .gp-check input, .gp-dev input { accent-color: var(--accent); }
  .gp-devtools { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
  .gp-devs { max-height: 210px; overflow-y: auto; margin-top: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; }
  .gp-dev { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 7px 10px; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer; }
  .gp-dev + .gp-dev { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .gp-dev:hover { background: var(--panel-hover); }
  .gp-dev-name { flex: 1; min-width: 0; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .gp-state { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); }
  .gp-state--inside { color: var(--moving); }
  .gp-devs-empty { margin: 0; padding: 12px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); text-align: center; }
  .gp-err { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: var(--danger); }
  .gp-foot { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .gp-spacer { flex: 1; }

  /* ---------- Mobile ---------- */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .fleet { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .fs {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: min(360px, 88vw);
      transform: translateX(-100%);
      transition: transform .25s ease;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      z-index: 20;
    }
    .fleet.sidebar-open .fs { transform: none; }
    .fleet.sidebar-open .fs-backdrop {
      display: block;
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, .35);
      z-index: 15;
    }
    .fs-close { display: grid; }
    .fm-fab { display: inline-flex; }
    .fm-banner { top: 64px; }
    .dp {
      top: auto;
      left: 10px;
      right: 10px;
      bottom: 10px;
      width: auto;
      max-height: 55%;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .vm-pulse, .dv--moving .dv-dot::after, .live i { animation: none !important; }
  }
</style>

